<title>USA: Computer Power names Tom Marren VP, CFO.</title>
<headline>Computer Power names Tom Marren VP, CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HIGH BRIDGE, N.J. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Power Inc said on Monday that it named Thomas Marren Jr vice president and chief financial officer, replacing Louis Massad.</p>
<p>Marrad would retire on December 31, 1996, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Marren held various management positions with Engelhard Corp from 1980 to 1994 and recently was a controller for one of Engelhard's largest business units.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
